<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-yan-vibrio-biofilm-nematic-fountain> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Beroz et al. (2018) Nature Physics & Hartmann et al. (2019) Nature Physics 3D rod-cell nematic verticalization and fountain flow in growing Vibrio cholerae biofilms (Vibrio cholerae (wild-type, Delta rbmA, Delta bap1 Delta rbmC, and A22/cephalexin cell-length-perturbed biofilms))",
        "Beroz et al. (2018) Nature Physics & Hartmann et al. (2019) Nature Physics 3D rod-cell nematic verticalization and fountain flow in growing Vibrio cholerae biofilms faithfully reproduces Vibrio cholerae (wild-type, Delta rbmA, Delta bap1 Delta rbmC, and A22/cephalexin cell-length-perturbed biofilms) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/yan-vibrio-biofilm-nematic-fountain-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/yan-vibrio-biofilm-nematic-fountain-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/yan-vibrio-biofilm-nematic-fountain-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2019-yan-vibrio-biofilm-nematic-fountain.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Vibrio cholerae (wild-type, Delta rbmA, Delta bap1 Delta rbmC, and A22/cephalexin cell-length-perturbed biofilms) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 93.7/100, audit 2026-10-19-vibrio-biofilm-nematic-fountain-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/e93f00e/2019-yan-vibrio-biofilm-nematic-fountain.py> ;
    schema:about "Vibrio cholerae (wild-type, Delta rbmA, Delta bap1 Delta rbmC, and A22/cephalexin cell-length-perturbed biofilms)" ;
